description:
Design a finite state machine that generates a 4-bit Gray code sequence. On each positive edge of the clock input, the module transitions through four states, outputting the corresponding Gray code value: 0000, 0001, 0011, and 0010. The state transitions ensure that only one bit changes at a time, characteristic of Gray codes, making it ideal for applications where minimizing errors during transitions is critical.
