Design a 4-bit shift register with enable, asynchronous clear, and serial input.
// (1) enable: Enables the shift register. Active high.
// (2) clear: Asynchronous clear of the shift register. Active high.
// (3) serial_in: Serial input to be shifted into the register.
// (4) clk: Clock signal.
// (5) q: 4-bit output of the shift register.
module shift_register(
